TEXT sec=s4 slot=eyebrow text="Flour that remembers the rain"
TEXT sec=s4 slot=title text="We buy grain from three farms [within ten miles]"
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="Rye" body="Ground from the farm on Tuesday morning."
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="Wheat" body="Milled locally, ready for fermentation by noon."
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="Hydroponics" body="Watered daily to keep the roots cool and green."
